# onnxruntime-node (pulled in by the in-browser TTS/embedding libs) downloads
# its CUDA GPU add-on from GitHub on every Linux x64 install. That release file
# started returning 404 on 2026-11-18, which broke `npm ci` in every CI job and
# cron (push delivery included). We never use the GPU path, so skip it.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
